     57,
     3
    ],
    "text": "IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1-2001/Cor&nbsp;1-2002, item XSH/TC1/D6/55 is applied, adding references to [I68][A69]exec[/A69][/I68] in the APPLICATION USAGE and SEE ALSO sections.",
